5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried we’ll pick a plan that makes us stop talking to each other. What matters most to you all right now?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the daily smell and mess. I want a solution that lets us all live peacefully without constant complaints.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I need to know the exact time cost. Every past arrangement failed because someone was left doing the work. I want hours, not guesses.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I’m nine, but I see it! One house has the bins at their gate forever. That’s not fair. We need a plan where everyone shares the burden equally, not just one family!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I hear your worries. Before we choose, we must know the true cost. Who will pay for the setup and the yearly upkeep?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, that’s a great point about fairness. @Servas, you’re right about the money. We need to check the actual costs and how the burden is shared before we decide.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, you are right. We must look at the costs and the daily reality. @Rin, your fairness point is very important.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, fairness is logical. @Servas, costs are data. We need to verify the ledger and the ward’s subsidy rules to see what is actually affordable for all five households.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I agree! But money isn’t everything. I want to see the measurements of our frontages too. If one house is tiny, how can they hold the bins?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, your instinct for fairness is wise. @Asuka, let us verify the ledger and subsidy. We must understand the financial reality before we can share the burden equally.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Shizue, I agree. We need to know what living next to these options actually feels like. @Asuka, let’s check the time costs too.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, yes, the daily reality matters most. @Asuka, I will look into the supervised mornings to see how much time it truly takes.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, supervised mornings give us the data I need. I will check the ward filing requirements to see if the timeline is even feasible for us.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, filing rules sound boring! I want to see the station block’s bin house. Did they actually like it? I bet it’s messy!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, curiosity is a fine guide. I will examine the block ledger and the ward subsidy to understand our financial footing.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, I’ll check the complaint log to see who is actually unhappy. @Servas, I’ll look at the residents’ meeting statements to understand our social standing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, that sounds wise. I will look into the station block’s bin house to see if their solution truly works, and the ward complaint log to understand our history.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will examine the supervised mornings to quantify the time burden, and the truck arrival time to define the operational window.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the frontage measurements to see who has space! And I’ll visit the station block’s bin house to see if it’s really as messy as I think!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I will review the ward filing requirements and the block ledger. Knowing the rules and our past spending is the foundation for any wise decision.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
