35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Shizue, the complaint log shows one house filed eleven of fourteen complaints. @Asuka, at the meeting, nobody volunteered to turn away late bags. We need a plan that doesn’t force us to be the bad guys.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, that is a heavy burden for one family. @Rin, the bin house smells worse than the open pile. We must find a gentler way.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, the data is clear. Supervised mornings average fifty minutes, totaling twenty per household yearly. The truck arrives between seven forty and eight fifteen. Any window must start before residents wake.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, I saw it! The bin house base can’t be hosed out, and it smells terrible in summer! Plus, one house only has ninety centimetres of pavement. How can they hold bins?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, your timing data is vital. @Rin, the narrow frontage confirms your fairness concern. I found our ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen yearly in avoidable costs, and a permanent build requires four months and five signatures.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, if the window starts before we wake, that’s impossible. @Rin, your frontage worry is real. We need a plan that doesn’t punish the smallest house or the early risers.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I understand your worry. @Rin, the smell is indeed a problem. We must find a way that is kind to everyone, not just convenient.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, the window is infeasible. @Servas, forty percent subsidy caps at ninety thousand yen. We need a plan that fits these hard constraints.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, that’s so early! I can’t do that. @Servas, forty percent is nice, but who pays the rest? We need a fair split!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, the ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen yearly in avoidable costs. @Asuka, the subsidy caps at ninety thousand. We must balance these figures with the four-month build time.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, if the window is impossible, we can’t force it. @Rin, let’s find a way that doesn’t make anyone the bad guy.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I agree. We must be gentle. @Rin, the smell is real, but so is the burden. Let us find a way that respects everyone’s home and health.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, the window is infeasible. @Servas, the subsidy caps at ninety thousand yen. We need a plan that fits these hard constraints.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if the window is impossible, that option is out! @Kenji, I agree, we need a plan where nobody gets stuck with the stink or the early alarm!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, the window is indeed too tight. @Rin, the ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen yearly in avoidable costs. We must find a solution that respects both our time and our wallets.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, I agree. We need a plan that keeps our friendship. @Servas, let’s hope the next options respect our time and wallets.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I agree. We must choose wisely. @Rin, let us hope the new options are kind to our mornings and our noses.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, I agree. We need a plan that is sustainable. @Servas, the financial data is clear. We must choose an option that fits our budget and time constraints.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, I agree! We need a plan that is fair and doesn’t stink! @Servas, please tell us the options now!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, patience is a virtue. The options will arrive shortly. Let us listen with open hearts and clear minds.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
